WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.580
Stairs and knee pain. A few dos and don'ts.

00:04.080 --> 00:11.050
A common myth is that you should avoid stairs completely. In fact, using them gently helps keep your knee strong.

00:11.550 --> 00:15.130
Do hold the handrail, and take one step at a time.

00:15.630 --> 00:23.200
Remember: up with the good, down with the bad. Going up, step first with your good leg. Coming down, lead with the sore leg.

00:23.700 --> 00:31.680
Don't rush, and don't carry heavy loads up and down. If stairs cause sharp pain or swelling, see your doctor.
